1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:05,325
On an enthalpy diagram, an exothermic reaction goes downhill.

2
00:00:05,325 --> 00:00:11,484
Products sit below reactants, heat flows out, and delta H is negative.

3
00:00:11,484 --> 00:00:19,335
An endothermic reaction goes uphill: products above reactants, heat flows in, delta H positive.

